1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Every enquiry at Casa Escondida starts
the same way: a message on WhatsApp.

2
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:21,000
It is rarely tidy. Dates, headcount and
special requests arrive in one paragraph.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Here is a real one. Daniel is travelling
with his family.

4
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:37,000
Five people, three nights, and only two
of them dive.

5
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Watch what the assistant pulls out of
that single message.

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:53,000
It captures the name, the arrival date,
the length of stay and the group size.

7
00:00:54,500 --> 00:01:03,000
And critically, it separates the two divers
from the three snorkellers.

8
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:09,000
That one number decides the price of the
dive package.

9
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:17,500
Then it asks only for what is genuinely
missing. Daniel never repeats himself.

10
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Daniel replies in plain language: two rooms,
diving on the eighteenth and nineteenth.

11
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:36,000
The assistant confirms the dive days, updates
the rooms, and keeps the summary in step.

12
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:46,500
When the picture is complete, the guest gets
a clear summary in their own language.

13
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Notice the last line. Nothing is booked,
and no price is promised.

14
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:59,000
The assistant is not allowed to quote
a rate on its own.

15
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,500
That is deliberate. Every enquiry lands here
for a human to review.

16
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:17,000
The details are already filled in from the
conversation: rooms, nights, meals, two dive places.

17
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:24,000
Your team adjusts anything that needs
judgement, then approves.

18
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:29,000
Only then does the guest receive
a quotation.

19
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:38,000
The assistant handles the back-and-forth.
Your team keeps every decision about money.

20
00:02:39,500 --> 00:02:44,000
Casa Escondida, built by TechNext Edge.
